sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Gateway
    participant OrderService
    participant Kafka
    participant BillingService
    participant UserService
    participant NotificationService

    Client->>Gateway: POST /orders
    Gateway->>Gateway: Validate token
    Gateway->>OrderService: POST /orders (X-User-Id)
    
    OrderService->>OrderService: Save order (PENDING)
    OrderService->>Kafka: Publish OrderCreatedEvent
    
    OrderService-->>Gateway: Order accepted (202)
    Gateway-->>Client: 202 Accepted
    
    Kafka->>BillingService: OrderCreatedEvent
    BillingService->>BillingService: Process payment
    
    alt Payment successful
        BillingService->>Kafka: Publish PaymentSucceededEvent
    else Payment failed
        BillingService->>Kafka: Publish PaymentFailedEvent
    end
    
    Kafka->>OrderService: Payment event
    OrderService->>OrderService: Update order status
    
    OrderService->>UserService: GET /internal/me
    UserService-->>OrderService: UserProfileResponse
    
    OrderService->>Kafka: Publish OrderStatusChangedEvent
    
    par Параллельная обработка
        Kafka->>NotificationService: OrderStatusChangedEvent
        NotificationService->>NotificationService: Send notification
    end